    defaultPrim = "offsets"
    doc = "Forgery fps-over-tcps on piece sub48: framesPerSecond 12 read before timeCodesPerSecond 48: stretched by 2, not 0.5, the cart never leaves the start. This is what a viewer with that bug shows; the correct exhibit is ../offsets.usda. Generated by usd-tour museum/src/export.py (usd-tour 0072026); do not edit. See README.md."
